This plugin embeds the DeepSeek web chat inside DeepSeek Harness by requesting a
guest lease from the desktop preload bridge (`globalThis.dshDesktop.browser`) and
mounting a `<webview>`. That approach, and the shape of the login-snapshot idea
(localStorage capture/restore around a memory-only browser partition), follow
dsh-dschat by Jakcet:

  https://github.com/Jakcet/dsh-dschat
  MIT License, Copyright (c) Jakcet

No source file from that project is included here: the code in this package was
written for this plugin (keep-alive surface, URL memory, host routes, icon and UI
are original). The attribution above covers the technique and API usage.

Third-party services: this plugin loads https://chat.deepseek.com/ in a webview.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek. "DeepSeek" is a
trademark of its owner.
